PracticeItems.Prompt:
What is printed by the following code?

for (int i = 1; i <= 3; i++) {
    for (int j = 1; j <= 2; j++) {
        System.out.print(i * j + " ");
    }
}

How many total times will the inner System.out.println statement execute?

for (int i = 0; i < 4; i++) {
    for (int j = 0; j < i; j++) {
        System.out.println(j);
    }
}

Consider this nested loop trace. What value does 'sum' hold immediately after the outer loop finishes?

int sum = 0;
for (int i = 1; i <= 2; i++) {
    for (int j = 1; j <= 3; j++) {
        sum += 1;
    }
}
